  "releaseNotes": "## v1.11.4 (patch)\n\nChanges since v1.11.3:\n\n- Test that choosing a reference skips a copy that already matches it ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Check for matching content inside the sync's own error handling ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Check the whole file for invalid UTF-8 before a merge writes it back [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Offer differing versions for sync instead of identical copies [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))",
